@ 0 4 0 0c64b64dfe70792d122cdaa0998f660b
+   entry .duration   任何 `Abstractable across Durations to Long` 类型都是 `Schedulable`，作为时长
+   entry .instant   任何 `Abstractable across Instants to Long` 类型都是 `Schedulable`，作为唤醒的瞬时
